  "password": "Annisa123."
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### coba send email verifikasi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification/01m65r0evffxw17vvv44kdvcwy

### Schedules List
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Specific Schedule Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/01j9yabcdefghjkmnpqrstvwxz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Therapy Sessions - Status: scheduled
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_sessions?status=scheduled&per_page=100&page=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Therapy Sessions - Status: scheduled + today filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_sessions?status=scheduled&date=2026-10-12&per_page=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Therapy Sessions - Status: pending (overdue: past date, pending/present, no SOAP)
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_sessions?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Therapy Sessions - Status: rescheduled (original sessions that were rescheduled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_sessions?status=rescheduled
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Therapy Sessions - Status: completed (present + has SOAP)
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_sessions?status=completed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Single Session Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_sessions/01m4z392jz5qsy8ky6mgbq948q
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Single Therapy SOAP Detail (by Session ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps/01m4fybg7bergjaymvdmq4xyaf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Therapy SOAP
POST {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "therapy_session_id": "01m4q9k69ht6r8b4acmqrver1z",
  "performed_at": "2026-10-12 10:00:00",
  "therapy_diagnosis": "Sensory Processing Disorder & Fine Motor Delay",
  "interventions": "Latihan modulasi sensori proprioseptif dan penguatan cengkeraman pincer grasp",
  "subjective": "Orang tua melaporkan anak masih sering gelisah saat duduk menulis lebih dari 10 menit.",
  "objective": "Anak mampu fokus selama 15 menit dengan bantuan media sensorik. Pincer grasp meningkat pada aktivitas meronce manik-manik sedang.",
