Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Export Filter Options (Current Therapist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps/export?child_id[]=01m5j5vz2txevej7j8cbep5d0g&child_id[]=01m5j5vzbbbqhjnpdc5qafd9wp&therapy_type[]=okupasi&therapy_type[]=wicara
### Export Filter Options (Current Therapist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps/export?therapist_id[]=01m5j5vwmp2rwabnrv893ctv2j&child_id[]=01m5j5vz2txevej7j8cbep5d0g
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export SOAP Data - Daily
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps/export?period_type=daily&date=2026-10-19
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export SOAP Data - Weekly (Week Number)
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps/export?period_type=weekly&week=43&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export SOAP Data - Monthly
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps/export?period_type=monthly&month=10&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export SOAP Data - Custom Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/therapy_soaps/export?period_type=custom&date_from=2026-10-01&date_to=2026-10-22&child_id[]=01m5j5vz2txevej7j8cbep5d0g&child_id[]=01m5j5vzbbbqhjnpdc5qafd9wp&therapy_type=okupasi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

